sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Listener as TCP Listener
    participant Server as http.Server
    participant Conn as conn (goroutine)
    participant Handler as User Handler

    Client->>Listener: TCP 连接
    Listener->>Server: Accept()
    Server->>Conn: go c.serve(ctx)

    loop Keep-Alive 循环
        Conn->>Conn: readRequest()
        Conn->>Handler: ServeHTTP(w, r)
        Handler->>Handler: 解析请求
        Handler->>Handler: 业务逻辑
        Handler->>Conn: 写入响应
        Conn->>Client: HTTP Response
    end

    Note over Conn: 连接关闭或超时
